          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T1 BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T2 BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T3 BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T4 BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T5 BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T6 BARREME (04) 09.05.1983 T7",
          "text_sha256": "cb2d5cf17bcfc2630560c4a25b7a0c8db659247345623de643e885ee145bc0ee"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
